      "writtenOn": "2026-01-08T22:03:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I see. In the case where we `lock`, we enable the MPU region and in the case where we unlock, we disable the enforcement completely (rather than setting the attributes to something more permissive).\n\nOne additional question: does RISC-V PMP have an option to enable read/write for only privileged or unprivileged access? e.g., like [this](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/core/cortex-m/include/mpu.h;l\u003d73-78;drc\u003dce133b4bf51ceef7abff0e7f56c6f8e81a12a521)?",
