      "writtenOn": "2026-01-08T22:06:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure about the privileged vs. unprivileged in RISCV. I believe there is the equivalent M-mode vs. U-Mode. We operate in M-Mode. U-Mode will have no privileges to change the PMP from Memory attributes.",
