      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not believe the U-mode has access to this region. This region is set using MEM-ATTR and U-mode will not have this region\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/arch/riscv/core/pmp.c;l\u003d704?q\u003dpmp.c\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d703-,704,-705\n\nthe U-mode will only have access to the global region prior to the ones generated from MEM-ATTR and the rollback region is created using MEM_ATTR config",
